  "observations": [
    "TieSuoLianHuan ctor sets minTargetCnt=0,maxTargetCnt=2,cardUseType=USE|RESET. getMinTargetCnt retains restrictions on virtual cards, extra skills, MuNiu cards and response states.",
    "GameSelfSeatUi.startSelectCard registers playCardResult and selectCardResult with the normal GameButtonBar. playCardButtonEnabledCallback allows BUTTON_OK when card and target selectors are complete.",
